<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-16T14:57:29.536Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 14:57:29 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army repelled a joint RSF-SPLM-N attack in Blue Nile, inflicting heavy losses on the attackers, while RSF forces detained over 6,500 people in West Darfur under worsening conditions. Drone strikes and air raids have targeted gold mining sites near the Egypt border and illicit mining activities, killing dozens of miners and causing civilian casualties in West Kordofan. Egypt has halted truck transit to Sudan after the fatal shooting of two Egyptian drivers and is intensifying strikes on illicit mining activities. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024 were recorded, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168577&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1KMVplaXVfYi1HbkNmc0k0UHhyUWZNX2sxOFMyM19EblZSYVlycEwxQUQ5eWFpdFhZbWNscUUtdm5mZ2hYeE1BaVB3S3VxNGsxRDBwN2lpZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQU2VONDlQSmpCSUpDeFlBb1FkTnM4OXlDeG5KekdUcVptQWtJT2kxaVhHaTl3WVY4U1J5YXphejJhODk1NWxaZEYzcDd6NHVyTmg2UUxYa1BjNmltM0pKTG9BU0Ezd2NqRm9GcFdGOHJROGhXdmFVVUdzNlJ5ck9veVJHR0V1dF9uU3hyNnc1Q080a0psY3BicE5OeEQ5SHlRZnZhZ1lkQUoxeUlpRVZKQUZ0dWRMSEhh?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNbkZLR0ZoTUxkZTE3TnE4QmpBTGYweHlnRnRiWXE0Zi1FdUVFTEJBdHVhdjBCY0t6ajNzcm1QeF9WWjVDeGdOU0RsMlZVcEw2T0tpOC1vNXlmMGVzU180QTE5Q1ZUUUtOcmJTZV80RWs4UEdYV280Z21KR2pVNy1kelNyTmxjQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mirage News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNN21rLXNNTHFSTXdEMmk2NTJOTGJLNjJyMzd1UlRza2twUG5WSTNRMng1WUJFX3hub2tzSmw0LVg1OG8wOHppR1hpajNNbWFmT3NJYTltQWN3UjVhakt1eUhaaDdNSEV4VTMxTU9pTVIydXVxN2hPVW